        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".counter-container": {
              "ul": {
                "margin": "0",
                "list-style": "none",
                "padding-left": "2.5rem",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem",
                  "position": "relative",
                  "& when (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "list-style": "none",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "padding-left": "1rem",
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-40px",
                      "content": "\"\"",
                      "display": "flex",
                      "justify-content": "center",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "color": "contrast(@iconColor)",
                      "background-color": "@iconColor",
                      "width": "40px",
                      "height": "40px",
                      "border-radius": "50%",
                      "margin-top": "5px",
                      "& when (@countersType = \"circle\")": {
                        "background": "none",
                        "border": "1px solid @iconColor",
                        "color": "@iconColor"
                      },
                      "& when (@countersType = \"square\")": {
                        "border-radius": "0"
                      },
                      "& when (@mark)": {
                        "content": "\"✓\""
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "& when not (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-1.6rem",
                      "content": "\"\\2022\"",
                      "color": "@iconColor",
                      "font-weight": "bold",
                      "font-size": "2rem",
                      "width": "1.6rem",
                      "line-height": "1.2"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "content8",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content8\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Mark\" name=\"mark\" checked condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <select title=\"Type\" name=\"countersType\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n            <option value=\"default\" selected>Сircle Fill</option>\n            <option value=\"circle\">Circle</option>\n            <option value=\"square\">Square</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#18356a\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Shape your future web project with the Mobirise app.\n                </h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Supports Healthy Blood Sugar Management: </b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Maintaining healthy blood sugar levels is an important part of overall wellness. Sugar Defender contains ingredients such as Gymnema Sylvestre and Chromium that have been studied for their possible roles in glucose metabolism. However, research findings are mixed, and the presence of these ingredients does not guarantee improved blood sugar control. Healthy eating habits, regular physical activity, and appropriate medical care remain essential. People with diabetes should continue following their healthcare provider's recommendations and should not use Sugar Defender as a replacement for prescribed medication.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Supports Normal Metabolic Function: </b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">The body's metabolism helps convert food into the energy needed for everyday activities. Sugar Defender includes ingredients that are commonly used in supplements focused on metabolic wellness. Chromium, in particular, is an essential trace mineral involved in normal carbohydrate, fat, and protein metabolism. However, taking a supplement does not automatically improve metabolic health, especially when a person already gets sufficient nutrients through their diet. A balanced eating pattern, consistent activity, and healthy daily habits remain the foundation of normal metabolic function.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Complements a Healthy Lifestyle:</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"> A consistent wellness routine is built on small, sustainable habits rather than one single product. Sugar Defender may appeal to adults who prefer supplements containing botanical ingredients as part of their daily routine. Ingredients such as Maca Root and Ginseng are traditionally used in products focused on general vitality. Nevertheless, supplements work differently for different people, and their benefits depend on the formulation and individual circumstances. Combining informed supplement choices with nutritious meals, regular exercise, and adequate sleep is a more practical approach to supporting long-term well-being.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Enhances Mental Clarity and Focus: </b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Balanced blood sugar levels are essential for optimal brain function. Sugar Defender helps reduce fluctuations that often lead to brain fog and difficulty concentrating. By providing a steady energy supply to the brain, it supports improved mental clarity, sharper focus, and better cognitive performance. This benefit is especially valuable for individuals who need to remain alert, focused, and productive throughout demanding daily schedules.</span></li><li><b>Promotes Overall Metabolic Health:&nbsp; </b>In addition to blood sugar support, Sugar Defender contributes to overall metabolic health. Its blend of essential nutrients, vitamins, and plant-based ingredients helps the body process nutrients more efficiently. This leads to improved digestion, better energy production, and enhanced cellular function. With consistent use, this comprehensive support can result in a more balanced metabolism and improved overall health and vitality.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "tB737Xejsa",
